cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use psyWiz in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "psyWiz: Confirmatory Factor Analysis, Measurement Invariance, and Visual Psychometrics"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/heelgueta/psywiz"
url: "https://github.com/heelgueta/psywiz"
authors:
  - family-names: Elgueta
    given-names: Herman
    email: herman.elgueta@umag.cl
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6764-5490"
abstract: >-
  A jamovi module and R package built on lavaan for single-scale evaluation,
  confirmatory factor analysis (CFA), step-by-step measurement invariance with
  partial invariance and latent mean comparisons, orthogonal bifactor modeling,
  exploratory structural equation modeling (ESEM) with target rotation,
  multi-estimator sensitivity checks, and variance-proportional visual
  psychometrics (Comb, Antenna, and Brush plots).
keywords:
  - psychometrics
  - confirmatory factor analysis
  - measurement invariance
  - bifactor model
  - ESEM
  - jamovi
  - lavaan
  - data visualization
